 A fast, keyboard-driven terminal viewer for tables, documents and databases,
 with an MCP server that lets AI assistants compute over the same files. Reads
 CSV, TSV, JSON, JSONL, YAML, TOML, Markdown, Parquet, Arrow, Excel, SQLite and
 DuckDB. Filtering, sorting, pivot tables, joins, computed columns, statistics
 and charts. JSON, YAML and TOML open as a table over the parsed document, so
 nested data can be browsed, edited and converted between formats. rowq
 continues tuitab, which stays at 0.11.1 and installs side by side with it.

